From: =?UTF-8?q?=E6=AE=B5=E5=BB=B7=E4=BC=9F?= <2624934035@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 11 May 2026 17:15:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] urma: fix unlimited help text typo in urma_ping

Fix the command-line help text for `-w` so the default deadline description is spelled correctly.

Signed-off-by: 段廷伟 <2624934035@qq.com>
(cherry picked from commit 652d5034f11cf00fe20c5c4a20c17c2b7908ce84)
---
 src/urma/tools/urma_ping/ping_parameters.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/urma/tools/urma_ping/ping_parameters.c b/src/urma/tools/urma_ping/ping_parameters.c
index 30457342..c68fd015 100644
--- a/src/urma/tools/urma_ping/ping_parameters.c
+++ b/src/urma/tools/urma_ping/ping_parameters.c
@@ -98,7 +98,7 @@ void usage(const char *filename)
               "  -c <count>       Packet count (default: INT_MAX)\n"
               "  -i <interval>    Interval between packets in seconds (default: 1)\n"
               "  -s <size>        Send buffer size in bytes (default: 4)\n"
-              "  -w <deadline>    Total execution time limit in seconds (default: umlimited)\n"
+              "  -w <deadline>    Total execution time limit in seconds (default: unlimited)\n"
               "  -W <timeout>     Per-reply timeout in seconds (default: 1)\n"
               "  -q               Quiet output\n"
               "  -v --verbose     Verbose output\n"
